<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo prices 500 mln marks 4-yr increase.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo prices 500 mln marks 4-yr increase.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, increased earlier to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks by joint leads BHF Bank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK HANNOVER</p>
<p> AMT **1.5 BLN DEM    COUPON     3.75	MATURITY    24.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.595    PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    97.44     SPREAD	+11 BP</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.225     LISTING    HANN	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.7	 SELL CONC  0.155     DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NOTES    **ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED 17.JAN</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 706</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
